n-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.4, p. 344; local structural induction"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-lemma-with-proof"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\mu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2\">\\(\\nu,\\mu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2\\)</span>。自由变量和语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"011094b454369426\" href=\"?note=011094b454369426\" title=\"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth\">73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\;\\nu(i)=\\mu(i))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mu}(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\;\\nu(i)=\\mu(i))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mu}(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow[\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{TQBF}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=1]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow[\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{TQBF}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=1]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结构归纳。量词情形中两种赋值在被绑定的 i 上都更新为相同 b，在其余自由变量上仍一致；分别比较两个 b 的真值，再取同一个最小或最大值。故闭公式语言不依赖定义时选用的全零赋值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth","status":"resolved","id":"011094b454369426","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth","status":"resolved","id":"011094b454369426","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}$，$\\nu,\\mu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2$。自由变量和语义见 [[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{QForm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu,\\mu:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n(\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\;\\nu(i)=\\mu(i))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mu}(\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}invariance}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow[\\varphi\\in\\mathsf{TQBF}\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}_{\\nu}(\\varphi)=1]","display":true}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-qbf-free-variable-invariance|QBF 真值只依赖自由变量]]"}],"outgoing":["011